      "title": "Marine & Boat Building",
      "slug": "marine-boat-building",
      "intro": "Engineered specifically for hulls, decks, and structural marine components, our Marine-Grade UPR delivers uncompromised strength and long-term protection against harsh ocean environments.",
      "benefits": [
        [
          "Superior Water & Osmosis Resistance",
          "Formulated to prevent blistering and degradation from prolonged saltwater exposure."
        ],
        [
          "High Strength-to-Weight Ratio",
          "Delivers lightweight structural integrity without sacrificing impact resistance."
        ],
        [
          "UV & Weather Resistant",
          "Maintains structural stability and finish under intense sun and weather conditions."
        ],
        [
          "Excellent Wet-Out",
          "Ensures seamless saturation with fiberglass mat and woven roving for defect-free laminates."
        ]
      ],
